text = "🌊 TIDAL ROLL
4 • 5 • 6
Strongest hand.

🎲 TRIPLE
Three matching dice.
Higher triple wins.

🐚 PAIR
Compare the matching pair first.
If the pair matches, compare the odd die.

Example:
3 • 3 • 2
beats
1 • 1 • 6

💀 WASHED OUT
1 • 2 • 3
Weakest hand.

Whoever rolls the stronger hand wins the round and
deals damage. No-point rolls automatically reroll."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

